<item><title>Gadzi sub-prefect accused of charging for neighbourhood chief posts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/gadzi-sub-prefect-accused-of-charging-for-neighbourhood-46b096/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/gadzi-sub-prefect-accused-of-charging-for-neighbourhood-46b096/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>Corbeau News Centrafrique reports that five or six houses now suffice to create a neighbourhood and appoint a chief, with payment demanded from those who want the post.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Audit finds 39% compliance at Central African Republic slaughterhouses</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/audit-finds-39-compliance-at-central-african-republic-84490a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/audit-finds-39-compliance-at-central-african-republic-84490a/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>A review of Bangui and Bouboui sites also says the operator failed to remit the state’s 25% share of revenues under its contract.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:52:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Central African Republic committee begins nationwide price checks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-republic-committee-begins-nationwide-price-8d04bb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-republic-committee-begins-nationwide-price-8d04bb/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>Created by the prime minister on 10 November, its three commissions will monitor essential goods, transport fares and petroleum supplies.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:47:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-republic-committee-begins-nationwide-price-8d04bb/share.jpg" length="41542" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/central-african-republic-committee-begins-nationwide-price-8d04bb/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Rugwabiza leaves Central African Republic UN post after four and a half years</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/rugwabiza-leaves-central-african-republic-un-post-after-8780e2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/rugwabiza-leaves-central-african-republic-un-post-after-8780e2/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>The outgoing representative cited security and institutional progress at a news conference and urged Central Africans to consolidate those gains.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:38:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>MSF adds 52-bed paediatric building at Bossangoa hospital</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/msf-adds-52-bed-paediatric-building-at-bossangoa-hospital-c8ccf3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/msf-adds-52-bed-paediatric-building-at-bossangoa-hospital-c8ccf3/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>The 343-square-metre ward was built to handle the seasonal influx of children with malaria and malnutrition in northern Central African Republic.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
